<section class="service-journey" aria-labelledby="service-journey-title">
  <header><p class="eyebrow">How we work together</p><h2 id="service-journey-title">A clear task.<br />An agreed way forward.</h2></header>
  <ol>
    <li><span class="step">01 / Discuss</span><h3>Bring the problem.</h3><p>Show us the tools, the task and what a good result looks like. If the work is unclear, we start by mapping it.</p><p class="artifact">First: a shared understanding.</p></li>
    <li><span class="step">02 / Define</span><h3>Agree the change.</h3><p>Confirm the deliverable, price, capacity and acceptance checks before payment. You decide what can change.</p><p class="artifact">Next: scope you can approve.</p></li>
    <li><span class="step">03 / Deliver</span><h3>Use what we build.</h3><p>Review the tested result and learn how to use it. Keep the instructions and recovery checks alongside the work.</p><p class="artifact">Checked handoff. Context for the next task.</p></li>
  </ol>
  <footer><p>Membership covers agreed improvements. Larger Builds, launch and production incident response require separate agreements.</p><a href="/services">Read the process and support scope ↗</a></footer>
</section>
